<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer-Irwin out of Ireland squad.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Irwin out of Ireland squad.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manchester United defender Denis Irwin on Wednesday withdrew from the Ireland squad for next week's World Cup group eight qualifier against Liechtenstein at Lansdowne Road because of an injury to his right groin.</p>
<p>Sunderland striker Niall Quinn pulled out on Tuesday because he needs a cartilage operation.</p>
</text>
